OL,3,GNEWSARape charge for most
OL,4,A'swiped-right' man on Tinder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was once described as "the
OL,7,Fmost swiped-right man on Tinder" is due
OL,8,Fin court charged with rape following an
OL,9,Falleged attack at The Groucho Club in
OL,10,Fcentral London.
OL,12,FStefan-Pierre Tomlin, 36, who in 2017
OL,13,Fwas said to be the most coveted man on
OL,14,Fthe dating app, is due at Southwark
OL,15,FCrown Court on Monday also charged with
OL,16,Ftwo counts of assault by penetration.
OL,18,FIt follows a Met Police investigation
OL,19,Fafter a woman reported she had been
OL,20,Fraped inside the private members' club
OL,21,Fin Soho on 13 November 2024.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
