OL,4,A'swiped-right' man on Tinder
OL,5,
OL,6,FTomlin, of Brentwood, was arrested in
OL,7,FHertfordshire on suspicion of rape in
OL,8,F2024 and charges were authorised in
OL,9,FSeptember this year. He appeared at
OL,10,FSouthend Magistrates' Court on 2
OL,11,FNovember.
